// Declaration sites for `core::intrinsic::<family>::<op>`. The operations
// themselves are checked and lowered by the compiler; these prototypes bind
// each one to a location via its `#[lang]` marker. The `array` and `cell`
// families' signatures (variadic indices, cell-kind polymorphism) are not
// yet expressible as prototypes and keep their compiler-only status.

